This directory contains verilog files required when compiling the
test wrapper and integrating the TCMs.

Before use change the following files:
  RAMS/A946ESDTCM.v
  RAMS/A946ESITCM.v
to instantiate the required DTCM and ITCM Rams. Also edit
  ARM946E_8888/A946ESParams.v
to set the width of the TCM address busses.
